\label{sec:sota}

Table~\ref{tab:sota_comparison} compares our results with recent papers that used the same or a closely related four-class dataset, which is the figshare/SARTAJ/Br35H combination. None of these papers report a cross-validated mean. They all report single-split accuracy. As discussed in Section~\ref{sec:related}, this tends to be optimistic. It also does not show how much the result might vary, and it does not show whether the result holds for more than one backbone.

